        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text_only": true,
          "content": "{% set b = states('input_number.climate_breaker_threshold') | int(3) %}{% set rooms = [('Living room','counter.climate_fail_living_room'),('Office','counter.climate_fail_office'),('Bedroom','counter.climate_fail_bedroom'),('Kids room 1','counter.climate_fail_kid1'),('Kids room 2','counter.climate_fail_kid2')] %}{% set ns = namespace(bad=[]) %}{% for n, c in rooms %}{% if states(c) | int(0) >= b %}{% set ns.bad = ns.bad + [n] %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if ns.bad %}🔌 **Isolated: {{ ns.bad | join(', ') }}** — comfort commands throttled to hourly retries; safety still runs at full rate. Clears itself the moment the unit obeys.{% else %}All five units responding to commands.{% endif %}"
